{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/926848-wta-the-omen","id":926848,"title":"WtA: the omen","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-05T22:04:43-07:00","id":926848,"title":"WtA: the omen","content":"Would be possible for the Wyrm itself to have a half human child the way Daiman from the omen is the devil's child? Because I was just reading <a href=\"http://www.alternet.org/news-amp-politics/top-10-lessons-strange-mirror-universe-ayn-rands-atlas-shrugged\" target=\"_blank\">this article on Ayn Rand </a>and I can't help but think of her as being the Wyrm's own child (assuming that the body that died of lung cancer wasn't really her).<br /> <br /> I just think it would be awesome to have a WtA version of Daimen running around and why not make it a woman?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-05T23:12:50-07:00","id":926873,"title":"","content":"Omen-Damian like children are accounted for by the Fomori known as Ferectoi. They represent any kind of Bad Seeds children who are &quot;born evil&quot;.<br /> <br /> I am not a fan of Ayn Rand, but I don't agree that she represents some kind of intrinsic evil. She grew up under Russian Communism and suffered intense evil because of it. As a result, she basically inverted Marxist dogma. Whatever the Marxists liked, she didn't and vice versa. Given the actual evil that occurred in this world, she's 60-80% on the side of angels.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T01:42:57-07:00","id":926926,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_8m8cQI4DgM\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_8m8cQI4DgM\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_8m8cQI4DgM\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_8m8cQI4DgM </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Never heard of her before I saw that. Maybe she's just an American thing...<br /> <br /> Anyway, if there was a half-human child of the wyrm, it probably wasn't conceived through regular sex. Unlike Zeus, the Wyrm can't just take human form and find himself a woman. The Wyrm is trapped after all, and he has an abundance of followers amongst the spirits who are basically avatars of a fraction of him, but never himself completely.<br /> <br /> So, there would be a need for some &quot;Immaculate Conception&quot;-like scenario. Possibly involving some Ritual or sacrifice or both. But, sure, such a creature could exist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T10:01:15-07:00","id":927142,"title":"","content":"Hmmmn heard the term &quot;Larva of the Wyrm&quot; in reference to Ferectoi, always wondered if they are going to go through some kind of metamorphasis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night